                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dbb9ea9d-933f-3488-b9a7-164f629c5184",
                        "entry_id": "612920a0-f40b-345b-9ea9-64cbba56576f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. тот, кто любит похохотать, часто смеётся громко и заразительно"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ab4e1370-b075-49c8-a9df-93a06af5bff2",
                                "sense_id": "dbb9ea9d-933f-3488-b9a7-164f629c5184",
                                "text": "Рослый, статный, румяный, голубые глаза с поволокой, русая коса и букли в пудре и распомажены, надушен, находчив, весельчак, танцор и хохотун."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "49835757-4a15-34ac-a83b-63321943c164",
                        "entry_id": "612920a0-f40b-345b-9ea9-64cbba56576f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "орнитол. крупная чайка, обитающая главным образом по берегам Каспийского моря и в восточной части Средиземного"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2c777c7-60ef-45e4-97a6-2757e3ec1fe9",
                                "sense_id": "49835757-4a15-34ac-a83b-63321943c164",
                                "text": "Помимо рыбы хохотуны питаются вредителями сельского хозяйства."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1c061b6c-8e94-4923-905f-9ed34718e598",
                        "source_entry_id": "612920a0-f40b-345b-9ea9-64cbba56576f",
                        "target_lang_word": "merry fellow",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3e36fa6a-3d8d-4d74-a438-4808ee3a8609",
                        "source_entry_id": "612920a0-f40b-345b-9ea9-64cbba56576f",
                        "target_lang_word": "laugher",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "laugher",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aef3419a-689e-3ca7-a97c-f82aaa371c5c",
                                        "entry_id": "43d3ebef-fec1-3c16-b5cd-1bcef30ee44b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who laughs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed2e0262-bb14-466a-9a01-960d3cb6042d",
                                                "sense_id": "aef3419a-689e-3ca7-a97c-f82aaa371c5c",
                                                "text": "Well then—if I must neither stir out of the gate nor look out at window, I will at least see what the inside of the house contains that may help to pass away one’s time—peradventure, I may light on that blue-eyed laugher in some corner or other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53325776-b84e-44d7-9620-46dcca5a03e0",
                                                "sense_id": "aef3419a-689e-3ca7-a97c-f82aaa371c5c",
                                                "text": "He and his companions[…] were exchanging jokes with that sort of ostentatious laughter which implies a desire to prove that the laugher is not mortified though some people might suspect it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5cbb8a1-c9c3-4935-b14a-496a8337b987",
                                                "sense_id": "aef3419a-689e-3ca7-a97c-f82aaa371c5c",
                                                "text": "These are the people whose laughter you hear after the boffolas on shows that have been filmed without audiences. I don't suppose all these laughers are dead, but a lot of them must be by this time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44823358-a0ef-3b08-ab24-7b35e79fa162",
                                        "entry_id": "43d3ebef-fec1-3c16-b5cd-1bcef30ee44b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game in which an opponent is defeated by a sizable margin; a blowout."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f4eadaf2-2c94-33f8-bd05-71e684b8f1d7",
                                        "entry_id": "43d3ebef-fec1-3c16-b5cd-1bcef30ee44b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A variety of the domestic pigeon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fb876ce6-8bc9-4b1a-8825-8d846c562158",
                        "source_entry_id": "612920a0-f40b-345b-9ea9-64cbba56576f",
                        "target_lang_word": "reidor",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e8b214a5-ed84-49a5-a1b2-88f79a2160ea",
                        "source_entry_id": "612920a0-f40b-345b-9ea9-64cbba56576f",
                        "target_lang_word": "uomo ridarello",
                        "target_lang_code": "it",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1ee84f2f-fdfc-4bcb-b9a5-fc8c142cd4dc",
                        "source_entry_id": "612920a0-f40b-345b-9ea9-64cbba56576f",
                        "target_lang_word": "Lacher",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Lacher",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "39b92465-db62-3ced-83c0-a8cbe8bab573",
                                        "entry_id": "e0a0a03f-60f9-314a-b9af-f71102d2b60b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die lacht"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "681855dd-4b0c-4e59-8d87-e96d700eeeec",
                                                "sense_id": "39b92465-db62-3ced-83c0-a8cbe8bab573",
                                                "text": "„Im jüngsten Teil ihrer Forschungsreihe haben Owren und sein Team untersucht, wie Lachen wirkt – und die Menschheit in Lach-Typen kategorisiert. Sie zeichneten 48 unterschiedliche Lacher auf und präsentierten sie dann 28 Testpersonen, die beurteilen sollten, ob und wie stark die Aufnahmen ansteckend auf sie wirkten.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f95ebe84-8424-4b65-9e41-5a641c70f5b9",
                                                "sense_id": "39b92465-db62-3ced-83c0-a8cbe8bab573",
                                                "text": "„Fred ist ein zuverlässiger Lacher.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6148cf0c-f235-49c3-9c34-7456ba44943a",
                                                "sense_id": "39b92465-db62-3ced-83c0-a8cbe8bab573",
                                                "text": "„Plötzlich lachte er mit seinem feisten, gutmütigen Lachen so laut auf, dass von verschiedenen Seiten her allerhand Leute sich erstaunt nach dem sonderbaren, einsamen Lacher umsahen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2078f9c-0d2e-433b-a17b-53c7b28fb068",
                                                "sense_id": "39b92465-db62-3ced-83c0-a8cbe8bab573",
                                                "text": "„Ich hatte die Lacher alle auf meiner Seite, und der junge Ratsherr machte sich fort.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5477700c-1b1b-3431-b792-3aa0c0e67ad6",
                                        "entry_id": "e0a0a03f-60f9-314a-b9af-f71102d2b60b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "kurzes, hörbares Auflachen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "802fda8e-b940-4c39-8607-2c5a832dffa4",
                                                "sense_id": "5477700c-1b1b-3431-b792-3aa0c0e67ad6",
                                                "text": "„Die Lacher während des Filmes kamen jeweils aus völlig unterschiedlichen Ecken des Kinos, als teste dieses sein neues Surroundsystem und schicke die Lacher wie einen Gummiball quer durch den Saal.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c51a5c30-25ca-3a72-a5c2-94dd94e86733",
                                        "entry_id": "e0a0a03f-60f9-314a-b9af-f71102d2b60b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Witz, witzige Bemerkung, die in eine Rede, ein Theaterstück oder Ähnliches eingebaut wird, um das Publikum zum Lachen zu bringen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da3adf06-de52-494e-98c2-ca62c0f186e4",
                                                "sense_id": "c51a5c30-25ca-3a72-a5c2-94dd94e86733",
                                                "text": "„Und natürlich kam der Humor nicht zu kurz. Kleine eingebaute Lacher lockerten das Stück auf und der heimliche Publikumsliebling war sowieso der etwas trottelige Mitbewohner Wenzel Kral, gespielt von Salvatore Martorana.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Lacher",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "196efaa4-cbcf-3c8b-a565-6522cd738599",
                                        "entry_id": "a3ffad9b-6fb2-38e8-8bf5-ece7e356af31",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "deutschsprachiger Familienname, Nachname"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f76c3bf-88a3-41d6-865f-60adc70a8f0c",
                                                "sense_id": "196efaa4-cbcf-3c8b-a565-6522cd738599",
                                                "text": "Herr Lacher wollte uns kein Interview geben."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fa995e7-48e5-4887-9540-b86674cea8a4",
                                                "sense_id": "196efaa4-cbcf-3c8b-a565-6522cd738599",
                                                "text": "Die Lachers fahren heute nach Erfurt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae95cf1b-2620-437a-9a5e-1d4e9f864cd1",
                                                "sense_id": "196efaa4-cbcf-3c8b-a565-6522cd738599",
                                                "text": "Der Lacher trägt nie die Pullover, die die Lacher ihm strickt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c10df0e-c2d5-45e3-bee1-f4092574fa48",
                                                "sense_id": "196efaa4-cbcf-3c8b-a565-6522cd738599",
                                                "text": "Das kann ich dir aber sagen: „Wenn die Frau Lacher kommt, geht der Herr Lacher.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "319118ef-1906-4d94-8dbb-68eda9067223",
                                                "sense_id": "196efaa4-cbcf-3c8b-a565-6522cd738599",
                                                "text": "Lacher kommt und geht."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49291a74-e902-4bb3-b963-6e8801dbc2b5",
                                                "sense_id": "196efaa4-cbcf-3c8b-a565-6522cd738599",
                                                "text": "Lachers kamen, sahen und siegten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c394ad66-2b34-43fd-9d77-806f9bedd588",
                                                "sense_id": "196efaa4-cbcf-3c8b-a565-6522cd738599",
                                                "text": "Frau Lacher ist ein Genie im Verkauf."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "68038b2c-2264-4df8-abf7-d05be0962349",
                        "source_entry_id": "612920a0-f40b-345b-9ea9-64cbba56576f",
                        "target_lang_word": "rieur",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rieur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c51928b2-1919-3735-9827-4a3b780d415b",
                                        "entry_id": "869948f5-3566-3e6d-ace3-2349a28ae6f1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui rit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46eb11cc-4689-449e-bff9-01550f601a91",
                                                "sense_id": "c51928b2-1919-3735-9827-4a3b780d415b",
                                                "text": "Je voudrais bien savoir comment vous feriez à ma place, messieurs les rieurs ?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8964786c-2387-3b2f-8df2-8605adec08c7",
                                        "entry_id": "869948f5-3566-3e6d-ace3-2349a28ae6f1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui aime à rire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42dd06e4-a4a7-471c-a901-26aebb476ef2",
                                                "sense_id": "8964786c-2387-3b2f-8df2-8605adec08c7",
                                                "text": "C’est un grand rieur, une grande rieuse."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "23633669-a66c-389f-9c78-6a5fdb90ba39",
                                        "entry_id": "869948f5-3566-3e6d-ace3-2349a28ae6f1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ancien nom du muscle risorius."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13548582-2213-495e-91bb-c035d783cb1f",
                                                "sense_id": "23633669-a66c-389f-9c78-6a5fdb90ba39",
                                                "text": "La première de ces remarques concerne la solidarité des quinze muscles du visage qui sont synergiquement contractés et dont les plus importants sont : le frontal, l’orbiculaire des paupières, le transverse du nez, l’élévateur de l’aile du nez et de la lèvre supérieure, le petit zygomatique, le grand zygomatique et le rieur ; tous plus ou moins congénères, en sorte que la contraction des uns facilite celle des autres."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rieur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6199a7b1-2738-3bc5-a98d-04d41a565bec",
                                        "entry_id": "af468ae0-f328-3ee2-8942-0dd0c8a82300",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui rit beaucoup ou facilement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d928f466-f9c1-486e-9b47-a9376c6e4346",
                                                "sense_id": "6199a7b1-2738-3bc5-a98d-04d41a565bec",
                                                "text": "Un patron accessible, direct et rieur, mais exigeant"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd435280-09a8-3fad-abef-aafc3efc9371",
                                        "entry_id": "af468ae0-f328-3ee2-8942-0dd0c8a82300",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est d’humeur à rire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "22b6bda0-9240-44b5-b6db-b652e7f051a3",
                                                "sense_id": "cd435280-09a8-3fad-abef-aafc3efc9371",
                                                "text": "La première journée du congrès est consacrée aux ateliers de discussion. Selon les journalistes présents, Laporte est détendu et rieur."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11816400-bba4-3288-af5d-4487639af34e",
                                        "entry_id": "af468ae0-f328-3ee2-8942-0dd0c8a82300",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(en parlant d’une partie du corps) Qui donne l’impression de rire ou accompagne un rire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8cf39ca1-f5e4-4a74-82dd-493086196000",
                                                "sense_id": "11816400-bba4-3288-af5d-4487639af34e",
                                                "text": "Sa petite stature et son visage rieur le faisaient automatiquement ressortir du lot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63105b35-1209-4d85-b2c5-7d99652472d2",
                                                "sense_id": "11816400-bba4-3288-af5d-4487639af34e",
                                                "text": "Les organisateurs des jeux de Tokyo-2020 ont annoncé mercredi la paire de mascottes choisie par les écoliers japonais pour incarner l’Olympiade: des personnages au style très manga, avec des oreilles pointues, de grands yeux rieurs et des « super-pouvoirs »."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e30c8cff-e8ec-4e1e-9cb1-caef26b67896",
                                                "sense_id": "11816400-bba4-3288-af5d-4487639af34e",
                                                "text": "Ce doit être l’approche des Fêtes qui donne envie de rigoler, comme ces bélugas « dont le bec rieur est surmonté d’un large front »…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
